      "explanation": "Borax bead test is performed only for coloured salt. Borax (sodium pyroborate), Na<sub>2</sub>B<sub>4</sub>O<sub>7</sub>.10H<sub>2</sub>O on heating gets fused and lose water of crystallisation. It swells up into fluffy white porous mass which melts into a colourless liquid which later form a clear transparent glassy bead consisting of boric anhydride and sodium metaborate.<br><br> <picture><source media=\"(max-width: 320px)\" srcset=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/1ksus9wsj/fd352163-777e-4fc8-be03-b6826eda089f/f9a39930-0771-11ec-a0ab-05c984536117/file-1ksus9wsk-320w.jpeg\"><source media=\"(max-width: 500px)\" srcset=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/1ksus9wsj/fd352163-777e-4fc8-be03-b6826eda089f/f9a39930-0771-11ec-a0ab-05c984536117/file-1ksus9wsk-500w.jpeg\"><source media=\"(max-width: 680px)\" srcset=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/1ksus9wsj/fd352163-777e-4fc8-be03-b6826eda089f/f9a39930-0771-11ec-a0ab-05c984536117/file-1ksus9wsk-680w.jpeg\"><img src=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/1ksus9wsj/fd352163-777e-4fc8-be03-b6826eda089f/f9a39930-0771-11ec-a0ab-05c984536117/file-1ksus9wsk.jpeg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;height: auto;display: block;margin: 0 auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"JEE Advanced 2019 Paper 1 Offline Chemistry - d and f Block Elements Question 20 English Explanation 1\"></picture> <br><br>Boric anhydride is non-volatile. When it react with Cr(III) salt then deep green complex is formed.<br><br> <picture><source media=\"(max-width: 320px)\" srcset=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/1ksusak32/a8d7592d-011e-48f1-aa9c-68e54ff0b1ea/0ba1ebf0-0772-11ec-a0ab-05c984536117/file-1ksusak33-320w.jpeg\"><source media=\"(max-width: 500px)\" srcset=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/1ksusak32/a8d7592d-011e-48f1-aa9c-68e54ff0b1ea/0ba1ebf0-0772-11ec-a0ab-05c984536117/file-1ksusak33-500w.jpeg\"><img src=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/1ksusak32/a8d7592d-011e-48f1-aa9c-68e54ff0b1ea/0ba1ebf0-0772-11ec-a0ab-05c984536117/file-1ksusak33.jpeg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;height: auto;display: block;margin: 0 auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"JEE Advanced 2019 Paper 1 Offline Chemistry - d and f Block Elements Question 20 English Explanation 2\"></picture> <br><br>Hence, option (c) is correct."
